## Quick reference

- Launch interactively: `{{HERMES_HOME}}/scripts/launch-<agent>.sh`
- Restart all proxies: `{{HERMES_HOME}}/scripts/start-proxies.sh`
- Stop all proxies: `{{HERMES_HOME}}/scripts/stop-proxies.sh`
- Per-agent details: `{{HERMES_HOME}}/bots/<agent>.yaml`
- Canonical model/port bindings: `models.lock.yaml` in the kit repo (single source of truth — bot YAMLs and this roster are rendered from it).

Each agent's folder contains symlinks to the brain files + role-scoped projects (created by bootstrap stage 40 at install time). Hermes sees the full `projects/` tree; scope other agents to the projects they work on.

Note: the junior agent (Ollama-backed) has no proxy port — Ollama itself is the server (default `localhost:11434`).
